<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-093" chapter-id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang" source-id="s-jinshu-093-chushuang">
  <p id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0000" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">褚爽</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0004" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">弘茂</persName>，小字<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0009" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">斯生</persName>，<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0012" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAD">恭思皇后</persName>父也。祖<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0020" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AA">裒</persName>，父<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0023" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAA">歆</persName>。<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0025" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">爽</persName>少有令稱，<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0031" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝安</persName>甚重之，嘗曰：「若<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0042" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">期生</persName>不佳，我不復論士矣。」為義興太守，早卒，以后父，追贈金紫光祿大夫。<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0077" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAA">爽</persName>子<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0079" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAA">秀之</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0082" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAB">炎之</persName>、<persName id="c-jinshu-093-chushuang:line092:m0085" ref="xke_dj3_6ba_AAAAC">喻之</persName>，義熙中，並歷大官。</p>
</text>
